        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JAGAR – Just a Game About a Rectangle is a minimalist 2D game that challenges your reflexes and precision. Take control of a simple rectangle through levels full of obstacles and platforming challenges that test your skill and quick thinking. Each stage requires calculated movements, precise jumps, and fast decisions — perfect for those who enjoy hardcore challenges and fast-paced gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision Platforming: levels designed to challenge reflexes and motor skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 Current Levels (with plans for more in the future): a campaign with increasing difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist and Abstract Style: straightforward gameplay with a clean, simplified visual aesthetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade and Retro: quick sessions reminiscent of classic arcade games, but with a modern twist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressive Challenge: linear stages that grow in difficulty, demanding perfect timing and reasoning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Singleplayer: ideal for players who like to beat their own records and compete against themselves.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re a fan of skill-based games or just looking for a minimalist and addictive experience, JAGAR delivers short, precise, and fun challenges that will test your patience and reflexes at every level.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JAGAR – Just a Game About a Rectangle is a minimalist 2D game that challenges your reflexes and precision. Take control of a simple rectangle through levels full of obstacles and platforming challenges that test your skill and quick thinking. Each stage requires calculated movements, precise jumps, and fast decisions — perfect for those who enjoy hardcore challenges and fast-paced gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision Platforming: levels designed to challenge reflexes and motor skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 Current Levels (with plans for more in the future): a campaign with increasing difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist and Abstract Style: straightforward gameplay with a clean, simplified visual aesthetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade and Retro: quick sessions reminiscent of classic arcade games, but with a modern twist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressive Challenge: linear stages that grow in difficulty, demanding perfect timing and reasoning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Singleplayer: ideal for players who like to beat their own records and compete against themselves.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re a fan of skill-based games or just looking for a minimalist and addictive experience, JAGAR delivers short, precise, and fun challenges that will test your patience and reflexes at every level.</p>",
        "short_description": "JAGAR is a minimalist 2D precision platformer where you control a rectangle through challenging levels filled with obstacles, precise jumps, and fast reflexes, perfect for quick sessions and hardcore challenges.",
